      "writtenOn": "2020-08-05T21:48:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027d guess that some of these may be bugs, but some may be because you\u0027re missing an important axis of information here -- the DependencyTag for the dependent module. Modules can be used for more than one purpose, so they may have multiple dependency tags, which are represented by multiple dependencies.\n\nFor a sample of the dependency tags defined by cc: https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/soong/cc/cc.go;drc\u003d807cfd2a9939ffd82aa0e26abc60a2c43cc1be59;l\u003d429\njava: https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/soong/java/java.go;drc\u003da7a64f3c5b259f29420eabe2bd4bd843f9ca589a;l\u003d546",
      "parentUuid": "6a07a2b8_8b0b6e10",
